    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are the AI Editor for Product Signal.\n\nYour job is to turn the selected top news signals into a concise daily intelligence brief for Product, AI, Technology, and Business professionals.\n\nBelow are the top 5 signals:\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.data) }}\n\nCreate a clear daily brief.\n\nFor each news item:\n- Write a short headline\n- Mention the source\n- Summarize what happened in 1 sentence\n- Explain why it matters in 1 sentence\n- Include the product takeaway in 1 sentence\n- Include the signal score\n\nThen add a short section:\n\"Today's Pattern\"\n\nIdentify the most important pattern or common theme across these 5 stories in 2-3 sentences.\n\nKeep the writing concise, professional, and insight-oriented.\n\nDo not invent facts that are not present in the input.\nDo not repeat the full article content.",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        2144,
        -48
      ],
      "id": "44f800d4-5341-47bd-89eb-0a6886318b65",
      "name": "AI Editor - Daily Brief"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
